{'symbol': 'CDAY', 'date': '2021-08-09 04:00:00', 'title': "PUREGYM, UK'S LARGEST GYM OPERATOR, SELECTS CERIDIAN TO DRIVE DIGITAL WORKFORCE TRANSFORMATION", 'text': "LONDON, AUG. 09, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CERIDIAN (NYSE: CDAY; TSX: CDAY), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (HCM) TECHNOLOGY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT PUREGYM HAS SELECTED DAYFORCE, CERIDIAN'S GLOBAL HCM PLATFORM, TO SUPPORT ITS RAPIDLY EXPANDING OPERATIONS AND IMPROVE EMPLOYEE ENGAGEMENT. DAYFORCE WILL DELIVER VALUE TO PUREGYM EMPLOYEES THROUGH FULL-SUITE HCM CAPABILITIES, INCLUDING WORKFORCE MANAGEMENT, TALENT MANAGEMENT, LEARNING AND DEVELOPMENT, AND PAYROLL."}